Minimal, spec-consistent fix in /home/user/aqualink-app/games/nba2k-threejs/src/hud.js line 136: exclude the globally reserved Input hotkeys from the 'any key skips halftime' handler so each key keeps its single documented meaning:

    // Any key skips the halftime overlay, except the global hotkeys owned by Input (P/Esc pause, M mute, T language).
    const RESERVED_KEYS = { KeyP: 1, Escape: 1, KeyM: 1, KeyT: 1 };
    this._on(this.doc, 'keydown', (ev) => {
      if (this.menu !== 'halftime' || ev.repeat || RESERVED_KEYS[ev.code] || !this.cb.onSkip) return;
      this.cb.onSkip();
    });

With this, P/Esc at halftime pauses in place (pause() already allows it; skipHalftime() is already guarded by !this.paused, and resume() re-shows the halftime overlay via showMenu('halftime') at game.js:272), and M/T only toggle mute/language. Optionally add an acceptance check next to A18: at HALFTIME press KeyM and assert state stays HALFTIME with #halftime visible and audio.muted toggled; press KeyP and assert state HALFTIME, paused true, quarter still 2. Tap-to-skip (#halftime click) and non-reserved keys are unchanged.

Minimal, in /home/user/aqualink-app/games/nba2k-threejs/src/hud.js line 136, exclude the Input hotkeys (and text-input targets, matching Input._isTextTarget) from the 'any key skips' handler:

    // Any key skips the halftime overlay, except keys Input owns (pause/mute/lang), which keep their single meaning.
    const SKIP_IGNORE = { KeyP: 1, Escape: 1, KeyM: 1, KeyT: 1 };
    this._on(this.doc, 'keydown', (ev) => {
      if (this.menu !== 'halftime' || ev.repeat || !this.cb.onSkip) return;
      if (SKIP_IGNORE[ev.code]) return;
      this.cb.onSkip();
    });

This keeps SPEC §8 'HALFTIME: 3.0 s or tap/key -> CHECK(Q3)' for every other key and tap, and keeps 'P/Esc = pause/resume' (SPEC §5 key table, §8 pause valid in any non-MENU/GAME_OVER state) working during halftime, since game.pause()/resume() already handle the HALFTIME case (resume re-shows the halftime overlay). Add an acceptance check next to A10/A18: in HALFTIME press 'p' -> state still HALFTIME, paused true, #menuPause visible; press 'p' again -> #halftime visible again; press any other key (e.g. Space) -> CHECK, quarter 3.
